31099::$$$message_0225_0000_0000$$$::"Oh, right. The training camp starts tomorrow!"[lr]::
31100::$$$message_0225_0000_0001$$$::I jump out of bed.[lr]::
31101::$$$message_0225_0000_0002$$$::The plans were made on short notice, but since I was there for the whole conversation, I can't just skip out now.::
31102::$$$message_0225_0001_0000$$$::"I need to get ready, fast.[lr]::
31103::$$$message_0225_0001_0001$$$::Um, first, two days of clothes..."[lr]::
31104::$$$message_0225_0001_0002$$$::I hurriedly pack my bags.[lr]::
31105::$$$message_0225_0001_0003$$$::The night passes in a flash.[lr]::
31106::$$$message_0225_0001_0004$$$::Once the sun rises, something I've waited impatiently for will come.j“fü